WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Step 1: Open Sales → Hourly sales → OpStack intelligence · Upload report, or Scan hourly sales report on Manager Home.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Step 2: Choose a CSV/XLSX report, PDF or supported image. Review its source text and selected pages, then press Read report.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3: Check dates, location, printed time intervals, hourly amounts and totals. Select Trading day or Calendar day if requested.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Step 4: Only select the full-day option when unlisted hours truly mean $0. Use Replace differing saved hours only for an intended correction.

5
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Step 5: Press Submit hourly sales in the popup footer. Wait for confirmation, then view the imported date.
